/File:PaintotchiPerformanceJob.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8f/PaintotchiPerformanceJob.png/revision/latest?cb=20230521033201","caption":"Диджей (Пикс)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:PaintotchiCreativeJob.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e9/PaintotchiCreativeJob.png/revision/latest?cb=20230521033201","caption":"Художник (Пикс)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Paintotchi-idl.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/7b/Paintotchi-idl.png/revision/latest?cb=20250723163528","caption":"На изображении · Паинтотчи"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Paintotchimix.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c0/Paintotchimix.png/revision/latest?cb=20180624211842","caption":"На изображении · Паинтотчи"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Paintotchi_Pix_Sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/40/Paintotchi_Pix_Sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250103215205","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Паинтотчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:IDLPaintotchiHappy.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2e/IDLPaintotchiHappy.png/revision/latest?cb=20230606030944","caption":"Радуется","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:IDLPaintotchiSad.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/76/IDLPaintotchiSad.png/revision/latest?cb=20230606030944","caption":"Грустит","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:IDLPaintotchiAngry.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c2/IDLPaintotchiAngry.png/revision/latest?cb=20230606030940","caption":"Сердится","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:IDLPaintotchiShock.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/16/IDLPaintotchiShock.p